#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186114976 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "82e970fe-cff8-50e3-9b94-67ad97b03da7" :knowledge-point/title "Finding a Power of a Matrix"}] :question/id #uuid "f832e671-b4bd-5d1d-81e7-b215a8ee4e27" :question/math-academy-id "e-4414" :question/problem "Find $A^4$ given that $\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$" :question/worked-solution "First, to find $A^2$, we multiply $A$ by itself:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nA^{2} &= A \\cdot A \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}9 & 0 \\\\ 10 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since\n\n$$\nA^4 = A^2 \\cdot A^2\n$$\n\nwe get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nA^{4} &= A^{2} \\cdot A^{2} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}9 & 0 \\\\ 10 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}9 & 0 \\\\ 10 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}81 & 0 \\\\ 100 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186114977 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "61443225-bc08-5d36-a603-3a1d7e392a98" :knowledge-point/title "Evaluating a Matrix Polynomial"}] :question/id #uuid "bea8819f-6feb-5de6-a585-4379378ccdbd" :question/math-academy-id "e-4417" :question/problem "Consider the matrix\n$\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}$\nFind $f(D)$ if $f(X)=-X^2+3X+2$." :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the polynomial, interpreting any constants as multiples of the identity matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf(X) &= -X^{2} + 3X + 2 \\\\\n&=-X^{2} + 3X + 2I\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we want to find\n\n$$\nf(D)=-D^2+3D+2I\n$$\n\nLet's calculate $D^2$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nD^{2} &= D \\cdot D \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix} \\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -10 \\\\ 0 & 9\\end{bmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can evaluate $f(D)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf(D) &= -D^{2} + 3D + 2I \\\\\n&=-\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -10 \\\\ 0 & 9\\end{bmatrix} + 3\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix} + 2\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 10 \\\\ 0 & -9\\end{bmatrix} + \\begin{bmatrix}3 & 15 \\\\ 0 & -9\\end{bmatrix} + \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}-1 + 3 + 2 & 10 + 15 + 0 \\\\ 0 & -9 - 9 + 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}4 & 25 \\\\ 0 & -16\\end{bmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186115866 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "61443225-bc08-5d36-a603-3a1d7e392a98" :knowledge-point/title "Evaluating a Matrix Polynomial"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b4fb7cc3-5aeb-5ddd-9cf0-3fbab6033d7f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 4 \\\\ 6 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186114568} {:answer/id #uuid "c9d25a78-6b54-59db-90df-948b54af3500" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186114569} {:answer/id #uuid "cf970816-aec0-5610-a43e-00df25333991" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 7\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186114570} {:answer/id #uuid "f46792ee-ff3c-5468-81ed-e3218f26d4b3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 \\\\ -3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186114571} {:answer/id #uuid "68fcda54-07b2-5a9e-a8e0-7d8b8c557e11" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -2 \\\\ -3 & 7\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186114572}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c9d25a78-6b54-59db-90df-948b54af3500" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186114569} :answer-field/id #uuid "75539ef4-3ad6-5964-bced-905551f374c8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186114567}] :question/id #uuid "12dbb97a-a553-543b-a68a-7b1edc9cc29f" :question/math-academy-id "q-78348" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $C = \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$. Find $f(C)$ if $f(X) = X^{2} - 2X - 5$."}]}
